(6932088, 1045138, 138253, '<td valign="top">BWAHAHAHAHAHA<br/>This made me burst out laughing when i saw it come up on screen. Bravo sir, your hairy ass will be forever immortalized here in what will likely be decried as immature and unwarranted, but it will be immortalized nonetheless.<br/> <br/>I had a similar idea, but my image was shot while i was sitting on the toilet, not hovering above it :p</td>', 'BWAHAHAHAHAHAThis made me burst out laughing when i saw it come up on screen. Bravo sir, your hairy ass will be forever immortalized here in what will likely be decried as immature and unwarranted, but it will be immortalized nonetheless. I had a similar idea, but my image was shot while i was sitting on the toilet, not hovering above it :p', '2012-12-14 00:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
