(6932109, 1044797, 138253, '<td valign="top">Well you''ve certainly left your footprint in all of our lives - this is definitely one of the most unique looking images i''ve ever seen and i find myself drawn into it, studying for more of what might be here. I feel that no matter how long i look i simply won''t find everything there may be to see in this.</td>', 'Well you''ve certainly left your footprint in all of our lives - this is definitely one of the most unique looking images i''ve ever seen and i find myself drawn into it, studying for more of what might be here. I feel that no matter how long i look i simply won''t find everything there may be to see in this.', '2012-12-14 01:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
