(6938922, 1044662, 114969, '<td valign="top">You live in a beautiful place, and you give it justice in your photos. Fantastic landscape.</td>', 'You live in a beautiful place, and you give it justice in your photos. Fantastic landscape.', '2012-12-21 08:09:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938923, 1044976, 114969, '<td valign="top">What an impressive sky, fits the challenge so well. I bet it was even more incredible in reality. Congratulations on the HM.</td>', 'What an impressive sky, fits the challenge so well. I bet it was even more incredible in reality. Congratulations on the HM.', '2012-12-21 08:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938926, 1044946, 19825, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, Anita. It is refreshing to see some playful whimsy among the many bleak entries.</td>', 'Fantastic image, Anita. It is refreshing to see some playful whimsy among the many bleak entries.', '2012-12-21 08:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938931, 1045059, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> I had my level on the camera I don''t think it''s tilted maybe the undulating horizon </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, the level can''t be wrong for sure. When I take landscape pictures and I find situations like this I prefer to <i>deceive</i> the viewer choosing which is my horizon, but surely it''s my choice. In any case a beautiful image - you have many nice landscapes lately :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: I had my level on the camera I don''t think it''s tilted maybe the undulating horizon   Well, the level can''t be wrong for sure. When I take landscape pictures and I find situations like this I prefer to deceive the viewer choosing which is my horizon, but surely it''s my choice. In any case a beautiful image - you have many nice landscapes lately :)', '2012-12-21 08:28:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938932, 1045059, 54446, '<td valign="top">Spectacular sky and good, subtle light on the landscape.  Well done!  Congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'Spectacular sky and good, subtle light on the landscape.  Well done!  Congrats on the top 10.', '2012-12-21 08:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938936, 1045163, 114969, '<td valign="top">Samantha, it is impressive how fast you can create your images, especially given the fact this one is so different from the previous one! Definitely not eye candy. Mud, dead vegetation, strange sky, strange corpses, no hope. Fits the challenge perfectly. Well done.</td>', 'Samantha, it is impressive how fast you can create your images, especially given the fact this one is so different from the previous one! Definitely not eye candy. Mud, dead vegetation, strange sky, strange corpses, no hope. Fits the challenge perfectly. Well done.', '2012-12-21 08:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938962, 1045142, 112739, '<td valign="top">What did I tell you, 5th or better. Congratulations Alessandro. This image is wonderful example of your creative skills at work. Glad to see it win HM for you!</td>', 'What did I tell you, 5th or better. Congratulations Alessandro. This image is wonderful example of your creative skills at work. Glad to see it win HM for you!', '2012-12-21 08:58:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938972, 1045074, 87808, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10, it is the little details like the hand and mask hiding in plain view that makes this a stunning piece of work. You seriously need to make a coffee book and start selling it, you would make thousands</td>', 'I gave this a 10, it is the little details like the hand and mask hiding in plain view that makes this a stunning piece of work. You seriously need to make a coffee book and start selling it, you would make thousands', '2012-12-21 09:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6938994, 1044793, 144365, '<td valign="top">My only ten never made it into the top 10. Lame. <br/>I thought this was vastly superior then the other entries.</td>', 'My only ten never made it into the top 10. Lame. I thought this was vastly superior then the other entries.', '2012-12-21 09:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6939000, 1044976, 117474, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, Bear! Really nice work!</td>', 'Gorgeous, Bear! Really nice work!', '2012-12-21 09:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6939003, 1044976, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2012-12-21 09:44:02.000000', NULL, 0),
