(6939323, 1045138, 137576, '<td valign="top">i gave it a 7 it would have scored higher had it not been for your girly legs, i love the way you wont conform to the way the conservative middle americans want you to and be all nice and vote 5.5 on everything and not rock their apple cart :) you keep sticking the finger and i''ll keep sticking nudes in every chance i can shoot them.</td>', 'i gave it a 7 it would have scored higher had it not been for your girly legs, i love the way you wont conform to the way the conservative middle americans want you to and be all nice and vote 5.5 on everything and not rock their apple cart :) you keep sticking the finger and i''ll keep sticking nudes in every chance i can shoot them.', '2012-12-21 14:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6939335, 1045074, 65319, '<td valign="top">Oh...a scene from Alien Nation.  Did only the newcomers survive?  Well, disconcerting but not entirely surprising.  I find the tonality of this image rather fascinating.  I would expect to have a sense of either the finite or the infinite in such a context.  However, despite my vague sense of moral yin/yang, this image leaves me rather nonplussed.  As usual, I know I''m in the minority, but I''m sure by now I''m also ignorable...;-)  Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'Oh...a scene from Alien Nation.  Did only the newcomers survive?  Well, disconcerting but not entirely surprising.  I find the tonality of this image rather fascinating.  I would expect to have a sense of either the finite or the infinite in such a context.  However, despite my vague sense of moral yin/yang, this image leaves me rather nonplussed.  As usual, I know I''m in the minority, but I''m sure by now I''m also ignorable...;-)  Congrats on your ribbon!', '2012-12-21 14:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6939457, 1045038, 113156, '<td valign="top">Well done on this, Zeppelins are so cool, congrats.</td>', 'Well done on this, Zeppelins are so cool, congrats.', '2012-12-21 16:59:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6939485, 1045074, 59029, '<td valign="top">Grats on the blue, Christophe, hope you bought your wife an extra  nice Xmas present for helping you with this one!<br/> <br/>I went with my gut and voted due to the emotions implicit here, not the nitpicky ''Oh the figures are too clean'', ''the light''s not quite right here and here'', some of which i can see here looking it in a more clinical light...but what''s the fun of that?! It''s the overall message and impact which you succeeded in delivering upon.  Very glad to have been one of your tens.<br/> <br/>btw, I do love the ground and surroundings.  Terrific.  And the toes of the figure with their toes dug into the dirt really got to me.</td>', 'Grats on the blue, Christophe, hope you bought your wife an extra  nice Xmas present for helping you with this one! I went with my gut and voted due to the emotions implicit here, not the nitpicky ''Oh the figures are too clean'', ''the light''s not quite right here and here'', some of which i can see here looking it in a more clinical light...but what''s the fun of that?! It''s the overall message and impact which you succeeded in delivering upon.  Very glad to have been one of your tens. btw, I do love the ground and surroundings.  Terrific.  And the toes of the figure with their toes dug into the dirt really got to me.', '2012-12-21 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
