(6942082, 1045138, 155577, '<td valign="top">I haven''t commented in a month or so, but had to log in for this. Love the shot!! Perfect lens choice, bold idea. I am just learning to process, and know its not that easy. Would love to see what could be done with this in the hands of a master processor. Kudos to the author regardless.</td>', 'I haven''t commented in a month or so, but had to log in for this. Love the shot!! Perfect lens choice, bold idea. I am just learning to process, and know its not that easy. Would love to see what could be done with this in the hands of a master processor. Kudos to the author regardless.', '2012-12-26 14:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
